{"id":"e9bb16015e70c461","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-clause-restriction.md","title":"子句集合在部分赋值下的限制","display":"df-clause-restriction — 子句集合在部分赋值下的限制","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-clause-restriction","aliases":["72-df-clause-restriction"],"display":"df-clause-restriction — 子句集合在部分赋值下的限制","depends_on":["[[72-df-clause-semantics]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §9.2 random restrictions, print607–612/PDF619–624; local explicit restriction interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-clause-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-clause-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clause-restriction — 子句集合在部分赋值下的限制"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a7ea013f9a55dcda\" href=\"?note=a7ea013f9a55dcda\" title=\"72-df-clause-semantics\">72-df-clause-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §9.2 random restrictions, print607–612/PDF619–624; local explicit restriction interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:D\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\rho:D\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为有限子句集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(l)\">\\(v(l)\\)</span> 为文字的底层变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_\\rho(l)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_\\rho(l)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(l)\\in D\">\\(v(l)\\in D\\)</span> 时调用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TrueLit}(\\rho)&amp;:=\\{p\\in D:\\rho(p)=1\\}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in D,\\ \\rho(p)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AssignedLit}(D)&amp;:=D\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in D\\},\\\\\nF\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho&amp;:=\\{C\\setminus\\operatorname{AssignedLit}(D):C\\in F,\\ C\\cap\\operatorname{TrueLit}(\\rho)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TrueLit}(\\rho)&amp;:=\\{p\\in D:\\rho(p)=1\\}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in D,\\ \\rho(p)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AssignedLit}(D)&amp;:=D\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in D\\},\\\\\nF\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho&amp;:=\\{C\\setminus\\operatorname{AssignedLit}(D):C\\in F,\\ C\\cap\\operatorname{TrueLit}(\\rho)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已有真文字的整条子句被移除；其余子句只删去已赋假文字。空子句若未被满足必须留下。输出的变量都在 V(F)\\D 内，因此限制不是把已满足子句改成一个空子句。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-clause-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-semantics]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:D\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"v(l)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_\\rho(l)","display":false},{"tex":"v(l)\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TrueLit}(\\rho)&:=\\{p\\in D:\\rho(p)=1\\}\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in D,\\ \\rho(p)=0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{AssignedLit}(D)&:=D\\cup\\{\\neg p:p\\in D\\},\\\\\nF\\!\\upharpoonright\\rho&:=\\{C\\setminus\\operatorname{AssignedLit}(D):C\\in F,\\ C\\cap\\operatorname{TrueLit}(\\rho)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"9d6016b6be7032da","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"06923f74277e2042","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["a7ea013f9a55dcda"]}